# [GOAL-HEAL-SEC-001 2026-05-23] Firebase Admin SDK service-account JSON
# (and any credential-bearing file shapes) must never live in public/.
# Real file is now stored on the firebase_private disk
# (storage/app/firebase/...). These globs are belt-and-braces against
# operator mistakes re-introducing the B3.2-001 vector.
/public/file/service-account-file.json
/public/file/*.json
/public/file/*.pem
/public/file/*.key
/public/file/*.p12
/public/file/*.pkcs12
/public/file/*.crt
/public/file/*.cer
/public/file/*.ppk
# Allow .htaccess inside public/file/ (defense-in-depth deny rule).
!/public/file/.htaccess
.env.e2e
